{
  "apiVersion": "dashboard.grafana.app/v2",
  "kind": "Dashboard",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "${dashboard_uid}"
  },
  "spec": {
    "editable": true,
    "liveNow": false,
    "preload": false,
    "cursorSync": "Crosshair",
    "timeSettings": {
      "from": "now-3h",
      "to": "now",
      "timezone": "browser",
      "autoRefresh": "1m"
    },
    "annotations": [
      {
        "kind": "AnnotationQuery",
        "spec": {
          "query": {
            "kind": "DataQuery",
            "group": "grafana",
            "version": "v0",
            "datasource": {
              "name": "-- Grafana --"
            },
            "spec": {}
          },
          "enable": true,
          "hide": true,
          "iconColor": "rgba(0, 211, 255, 1)",
          "name": "Annotations & Alerts",
          "builtIn": true,
          "legacyOptions": {
            "type": "dashboard"
          }
        }
      }
    ],
    "title": "Regulatory authoring (${prefix})",
    "description": "Fictional ICF and CSR section workflows, deterministic grounding and simulated review outcomes. Not validated for GxP.",
    "tags": [
      "${prefix}",
      "regulatory",
      "ai-observability"
    ],
    "links": [],
    "variables": [],
    "elements": {
      "boundary": {
        "kind": "Panel",
        "spec": {
          "id": 1,
          "title": "Fictional study authoring and capture boundary",
          "description": "Operational metadata remains available in both content modes.",
          "links": [],
          "transparent": true,
          "data": {
            "kind": "QueryGroup",
            "spec": {
              "queries": [],
              "transformations": [],
              "queryOptions": {}
            }
          },
          "vizConfig": {
            "kind": "VizConfig",
            "group": "text",
            "version": "",
            "spec": {
              "options": {
                "mode": "markdown",
                "content": "### Fictional demonstration only\n\nContent capture is **${capture_mode}**. These outputs simulate review and are not human approvals, submissions or regulatory validation. Review-state counts are recent completed outcomes, not a durable human queue.\n\nGrounding, reading grade, throughput and latency use in-app metadata metrics in both capture modes. Content-off mode omits free-form prompts and outputs; regex and LLM content evaluators cannot score them. SDK evaluation panels show pass/fail counts, not numeric scores. Open Agent Observability for captured examples and explanations.\n\nSDK costs are token-price estimates, not a billing ledger. Cost is available by agent only: document/section cost attribution is not emitted, so this dashboard does not invent it. Capture-on source telemetry records the guarded value, never raw patient identifiers.",
                "code": {
                  "language": "plaintext",
                  "showLineNumbers": false,
                  "showMiniMap": false
                }
              },
              "fieldConfig": {
                "defaults": {},
                "overrides": []
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "throughput": {
        "kind": "Panel",
        "spec": {
          "id": 2,
          "title": "Sections completed / hour",
          "description": "Each request drafts one section. Throughput is grouped by document type, section and simulated outcome.",
          "links": [],
          "transparent": false,
          "data": {
            "kind": "QueryGroup",
            "spec": {
              "queries": [
                {
                  "kind": "PanelQuery",
                  "spec": {
                    "refId": "A",
                    "hidden": false,
                    "query": {
                      "kind": "DataQuery",
                      "group": "prometheus",
                      "version": "v0",
                      "datasource": {
                        "name": "${ds_prom}"
                      },
                      "spec": {
                        "editorMode": "code",
                        "expr": "sum by (document_type,section,review_state) (rate(regulatory_requests_total{service_namespace=\"${prefix}\"}[$__rate_interval])) * 3600",
                        "legendFormat": "{{document_type}} / {{section}} / {{review_state}}",
                        "range": true,
                        "instant": false,
                        "refId": "A"
                      }
                    }
                  }
                }
              ],
              "transformations": [],
              "queryOptions": {
                "interval": "5m"
              }
            }
          },
          "vizConfig": {
            "kind": "VizConfig",
            "group": "timeseries",
            "version": "",
            "spec": {
              "options": {
                "legend": {
                  "showLegend": true,
                  "displayMode": "table",
                  "placement": "right",
                  "calcs": [
                    "lastNotNull"
                  ]
                },
                "tooltip": {
                  "mode": "multi",
                  "sort": "desc"
                }
              },
              "fieldConfig": {
                "defaults": {
                  "unit": "short",
                  "custom": {
                    "drawStyle": "line",
                    "lineWidth": 2,
                    "fillOpacity": 15,
                    "gradientMode": "none",
                    "showPoints": "never",
                    "pointSize": 5,
                    "barAlignment": 0,
                    "spanNulls": false,
                    "axisSoftMin": 0,
                    "stacking": {
                      "mode": "none",
                      "group": "A"
                    }
                  },
                  "color": {
                    "mode": "palette-classic"
                  },
                  "decimals": 2
                },
                "overrides": []
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "approval": {
        "kind": "Panel",
        "spec": {
          "id": 3,
          "title": "First-pass simulated approval ratio",
          "description": "Approved completed requests divided by all completed requests; no traffic is no data, not 100%.",
          "links": [],
          "transparent": false,
          "data": {
            "kind": "QueryGroup",
            "spec": {
              "queries": [
                {
                  "kind": "PanelQuery",
                  "spec": {
                    "refId": "A",
                    "hidden": false,
                    "query": {
                      "kind": "DataQuery",
                      "group": "prometheus",
                      "version": "v0",
                      "datasource": {
                        "name": "${ds_prom}"
                      },
                      "spec": {
                        "editorMode": "code",
                        "expr": "${metric_prefix}_first_pass_approval_ratio",
                        "legendFormat": "{{document_type}} / {{section}}",
                        "range": true,
                        "instant": false,
                        "refId": "A"
                      }
                    }
                  }
                }
              ],
              "transformations": [],
              "queryOptions": {
                "interval": "5m"
              }
            }
          },
          "vizConfig": {
            "kind": "VizConfig",
            "group": "timeseries",
            "version": "",
            "spec": {
              "options": {
                "legend": {
                  "showLegend": true,
                  "displayMode": "table",
                  "placement": "right",
                  "calcs": [
                    "lastNotNull"
                  ]
                },
                "tooltip": {
                  "mode": "multi",
                  "sort": "desc"
                }
              },
              "fieldConfig": {
                "defaults": {
                  "unit": "percentunit",
                  "custom": {
                    "drawStyle": "line",
                    "lineWidth": 2,
                    "fillOpacity": 15,
                    "gradientMode": "none",
                    "showPoints": "never",
                    "pointSize": 5,
                    "barAlignment": 0,
                    "spanNulls": false,
                    "axisSoftMin": 0,
                    "stacking": {
                      "mode": "none",
                      "group": "A"
                    }
                  },
                  "color": {
                    "mode": "palette-classic"
                  },
                  "decimals": 2
                },
                "overrides": []
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "states": {
        "kind": "Panel",
        "spec": {
          "id": 4,
          "title": "Recent review outcomes (queue proxy)",
          "description": "Completed outcomes in the selected range. These are not pending queue sizes or human decisions.",
          "links": [],
          "transparent": false,
          "data": {
            "kind": "QueryGroup",
            "spec": {
              "queries": [
                {
                  "kind": "PanelQuery",
                  "spec": {
                    "refId": "A",
                    "hidden": false,
                    "query": {
                      "kind": "DataQuery",
                      "group": "prometheus",
                      "version": "v0",
                      "datasource": {
                        "name": "${ds_prom}"
                      },
                      "spec": {
                        "editorMode": "code",
                        "expr": "sum by (document_type,review_state) (increase(regulatory_requests_total{service_namespace=\"${prefix}\"}[$__range]))",
                        "legendFormat": "{{document_type}} / {{review_state}}",
                        "range": false,
                        "instant": true,
                        "refId": "A"
                      }
                    }
                  }
                }
              ],
              "transformations": [],
              "queryOptions": {
                "interval": "5m"
              }
            }
          },
          "vizConfig": {
            "kind": "VizConfig",
            "group": "bargauge",
            "version": "",
            "spec": {
              "options": {
                "reduceOptions": {
                  "calcs": [
                    "lastNotNull"
                  ],
                  "fields": "",
                  "values": true
                },
                "orientation": "horizontal",
                "displayMode": "basic",
                "showUnfilled": true
              },
              "fieldConfig": {
                "defaults": {
                  "unit": "short",
                  "color": {
                    "mode": "palette-classic"
                  },
                  "decimals": 2,
                  "displayName": "$${__field.labels.document_type} / $${__field.labels.review_state}"
                },
                "overrides": []
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "latency": {
        "kind": "Panel",
        "spec": {
          "id": 5,
          "title": "Section request latency p95",
          "description": "End-to-end section latency, including specialist calls.",
          "links": [],
          "transparent": false,
          "data": {
            "kind": "QueryGroup",
            "spec": {
              "queries": [
                {
                  "kind": "PanelQuery",
                  "spec": {
                    "refId": "A",
                    "hidden": false,
                    "query": {
                      "kind": "DataQuery",
                      "group": "prometheus",
                      "version": "v0",
                      "datasource": {
                        "name": "${ds_prom}"
                      },
                      "spec": {
                        "editorMode": "code",
                        "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95,sum by (le,document_type,section) (rate(regulatory_request_duration_seconds_bucket{service_namespace=\"${prefix}\"}[$__rate_interval])))",
                        "legendFormat": "{{document_type}} / {{section}}",
                        "range": true,
                        "instant": false,
                        "refId": "A"
                      }
                    }
                  }
                }
              ],
              "transformations": [],
              "queryOptions": {
                "interval": "5m"
              }
            }
          },
          "vizConfig": {
            "kind": "VizConfig",
            "group": "timeseries",
            "version": "",
            "spec": {
              "options": {
                "legend": {
                  "showLegend": true,
                  "displayMode": "table",
                  "placement": "right",
                  "calcs": [
                    "lastNotNull"
                  ]
                },
                "tooltip": {
                  "mode": "multi",
                  "sort": "desc"
                }
              },
              "fieldConfig": {
                "defaults": {
                  "unit": "s",
                  "custom": {
                    "drawStyle": "line",
                    "lineWidth": 2,
                    "fillOpacity": 15,
                    "gradientMode": "none",
                    "showPoints": "never",
                    "pointSize": 5,
                    "barAlignment": 0,
                    "spanNulls": false,
                    "axisSoftMin": 0,
                    "stacking": {
                      "mode": "none",
                      "group": "A"
                    }
                  },
                  "color": {
                    "mode": "palette-classic"
                  },
                  "decimals": 2
                },
                "overrides": []
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "grounding": {
        "kind": "Panel",
        "spec": {
          "id": 6,
          "title": "Deterministic number grounding",
          "description": "Mean fraction of numbers matched against fictional source facts. Matching does not establish supported clinical claims; available with content capture off.",
          "links": [],
          "transparent": false,
          "data": {
            "kind": "QueryGroup",
            "spec": {
              "queries": [
                {
                  "kind": "PanelQuery",
                  "spec": {
                    "refId": "A",
                    "hidden": false,
                    "query": {
                      "kind": "DataQuery",
                      "group": "prometheus",
                      "version": "v0",
                      "datasource": {
                        "name": "${ds_prom}"
                      },
                      "spec": {
                        "editorMode": "code",
                        "expr": "sum by (document_type,section) (rate(regulatory_number_grounding_ratio_sum{service_namespace=\"${prefix}\"}[$__rate_interval])) / sum by (document_type,section) (rate(regulatory_number_grounding_ratio_count{service_namespace=\"${prefix}\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
                        "legendFormat": "{{document_type}} / {{section}}",
                        "range": true,
                        "instant": false,
                        "refId": "A"
                      }
                    }
                  }
                }
              ],
              "transformations": [],
              "queryOptions": {
                "interval": "5m"
              }
            }
          },
          "vizConfig": {
            "kind": "VizConfig",
            "group": "timeseries",
            "version": "",
            "spec": {
              "options": {
                "legend": {
                  "showLegend": true,
                  "displayMode": "table",
                  "placement": "right",
                  "calcs": [
                    "lastNotNull"
                  ]
                },
                "tooltip": {
                  "mode": "multi",
                  "sort": "desc"
                }
              },
              "fieldConfig": {
                "defaults": {
                  "unit": "percentunit",
                  "custom": {
                    "drawStyle": "line",
                    "lineWidth": 2,
                    "fillOpacity": 15,
                    "gradientMode": "none",
                    "showPoints": "never",
                    "pointSize": 5,
                    "barAlignment": 0,
                    "spanNulls": false,
                    "axisSoftMin": 0,
                    "stacking": {
                      "mode": "none",
                      "group": "A"
                    }
                  },
                  "color": {
                    "mode": "palette-classic"
                  },
                  "decimals": 2
                },
                "overrides": []
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "readability": {
        "kind": "Panel",
        "spec": {
          "id": 7,
          "title": "ICF estimated reading grade",
          "description": "In-app reading-grade heuristic for lay-language sections. Not clinical or linguistic validation; metadata mode retains this measurement.",
          "links": [],
          "transparent": false,
          "data": {
            "kind": "QueryGroup",
            "spec": {
              "queries": [
                {
                  "kind": "PanelQuery",
                  "spec": {
                    "refId": "A",
                    "hidden": false,
                    "query": {
                      "kind": "DataQuery",
                      "group": "prometheus",
                      "version": "v0",
                      "datasource": {
                        "name": "${ds_prom}"
                      },
                      "spec": {
                        "editorMode": "code",
                        "expr": "sum by (document_type,section) (rate(regulatory_reading_grade_sum{service_namespace=\"${prefix}\",document_type=\"icf\"}[$__rate_interval])) / sum by (document_type,section) (rate(regulatory_reading_grade_count{service_namespace=\"${prefix}\",document_type=\"icf\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
                        "legendFormat": "{{document_type}} / {{section}}",
                        "range": true,
                        "instant": false,
                        "refId": "A"
                      }
                    }
                  }
                }
              ],
              "transformations": [],
              "queryOptions": {
                "interval": "5m"
              }
            }
          },
          "vizConfig": {
            "kind": "VizConfig",
            "group": "timeseries",
            "version": "",
            "spec": {
              "options": {
                "legend": {
                  "showLegend": true,
                  "displayMode": "table",
                  "placement": "right",
                  "calcs": [
                    "lastNotNull"
                  ]
                },
                "tooltip": {
                  "mode": "multi",
                  "sort": "desc"
                }
              },
              "fieldConfig": {
                "defaults": {
                  "unit": "short",
                  "custom": {
                    "drawStyle": "line",
                    "lineWidth": 2,
                    "fillOpacity": 15,
                    "gradientMode": "none",
                    "showPoints": "never",
                    "pointSize": 5,
                    "barAlignment": 0,
                    "spanNulls": false,
                    "axisSoftMin": 0,
                    "stacking": {
                      "mode": "none",
                      "group": "A"
                    }
                  },
                  "color": {
                    "mode": "palette-classic"
                  },
                  "decimals": 2
                },
                "overrides": []
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "guards": {
        "kind": "Panel",
        "spec": {
          "id": 8,
          "title": "App guard outcomes",
          "description": "Source-tool protection outcomes; deliberate guard-policy probes can produce denies/redactions.",
          "links": [],
          "transparent": false,
          "data": {
            "kind": "QueryGroup",
            "spec": {
              "queries": [
                {
                  "kind": "PanelQuery",
                  "spec": {
                    "refId": "A",
                    "hidden": false,
                    "query": {
                      "kind": "DataQuery",
                      "group": "prometheus",
                      "version": "v0",
                      "datasource": {
                        "name": "${ds_prom}"
                      },
                      "spec": {
                        "editorMode": "code",
                        "expr": "sum by (guard,outcome) (increase(regulatory_guard_events_total{service_namespace=\"${prefix}\"}[$__range]))",
                        "legendFormat": "{{guard}} / {{outcome}}",
                        "range": false,
                        "instant": true,
                        "refId": "A"
                      }
                    }
                  }
                }
              ],
              "transformations": [],
              "queryOptions": {
                "interval": "5m"
              }
            }
          },
          "vizConfig": {
            "kind": "VizConfig",
            "group": "bargauge",
            "version": "",
            "spec": {
              "options": {
                "reduceOptions": {
                  "calcs": [
                    "lastNotNull"
                  ],
                  "fields": "",
                  "values": true
                },
                "orientation": "horizontal",
                "displayMode": "basic",
                "showUnfilled": true
              },
              "fieldConfig": {
                "defaults": {
                  "unit": "short",
                  "color": {
                    "mode": "palette-classic"
                  },
                  "decimals": 2,
                  "displayName": "$${__field.labels.guard} / $${__field.labels.outcome}"
                },
                "overrides": []
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "scores": {
        "kind": "Panel",
        "spec": {
          "id": 9,
          "title": "Online evaluator pass/fail counts / hour",
          "description": "Content evaluators require content capture. These are pass/fail counts, not score magnitudes.",
          "links": [],
          "transparent": false,
          "data": {
            "kind": "QueryGroup",
            "spec": {
              "queries": [
                {
                  "kind": "PanelQuery",
                  "spec": {
                    "refId": "A",
                    "hidden": false,
                    "query": {
                      "kind": "DataQuery",
                      "group": "prometheus",
                      "version": "v0",
                      "datasource": {
                        "name": "${ds_prom}"
                      },
                      "spec": {
                        "editorMode": "code",
                        "expr": "sum by (gen_ai_agent_name,rule,passed) (rate(agento11y_eval_scores_total{rule=~\"${quality_rules}\",gen_ai_agent_name=~\"${agents_re}\"}[$__rate_interval])) * 3600",
                        "legendFormat": "{{gen_ai_agent_name}} / {{rule}} / passed={{passed}}",
                        "range": true,
                        "instant": false,
                        "refId": "A"
                      }
                    }
                  }
                }
              ],
              "transformations": [],
              "queryOptions": {
                "interval": "5m"
              }
            }
          },
          "vizConfig": {
            "kind": "VizConfig",
            "group": "timeseries",
            "version": "",
            "spec": {
              "options": {
                "legend": {
                  "showLegend": true,
                  "displayMode": "table",
                  "placement": "right",
                  "calcs": [
                    "lastNotNull"
                  ]
                },
                "tooltip": {
                  "mode": "multi",
                  "sort": "desc"
                }
              },
              "fieldConfig": {
                "defaults": {
                  "unit": "short",
                  "custom": {
                    "drawStyle": "line",
                    "lineWidth": 2,
                    "fillOpacity": 15,
                    "gradientMode": "none",
                    "showPoints": "never",
                    "pointSize": 5,
                    "barAlignment": 0,
                    "spanNulls": false,
                    "axisSoftMin": 0,
                    "stacking": {
                      "mode": "none",
                      "group": "A"
                    }
                  },
                  "color": {
                    "mode": "palette-classic"
                  },
                  "decimals": 2
                },
                "overrides": []
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "cost": {
        "kind": "Panel",
        "spec": {
          "id": 10,
          "title": "Estimated SDK generation cost / hour by agent",
          "description": "Actual SDK cost series only; no fabricated document/section allocation. Stub model calls may not emit generation costs. Estimates exclude non-model infrastructure.",
          "links": [],
          "transparent": false,
          "data": {
            "kind": "QueryGroup",
            "spec": {
              "queries": [
                {
                  "kind": "PanelQuery",
                  "spec": {
                    "refId": "A",
                    "hidden": false,
                    "query": {
                      "kind": "DataQuery",
                      "group": "prometheus",
                      "version": "v0",
                      "datasource": {
                        "name": "${ds_prom}"
                      },
                      "spec": {
                        "editorMode": "code",
                        "expr": "sum by (gen_ai_agent_name) (rate(agento11y_generation_cost_usd_total{gen_ai_agent_name=~\"${agents_re}\"}[$__rate_interval])) * 3600",
                        "legendFormat": "{{gen_ai_agent_name}}",
                        "range": true,
                        "instant": false,
                        "refId": "A"
                      }
                    }
                  }
                }
              ],
              "transformations": [],
              "queryOptions": {
                "interval": "5m"
              }
            }
          },
          "vizConfig": {
            "kind": "VizConfig",
            "group": "timeseries",
            "version": "",
            "spec": {
              "options": {
                "legend": {
                  "showLegend": true,
                  "displayMode": "table",
                  "placement": "right",
                  "calcs": [
                    "lastNotNull"
                  ]
                },
                "tooltip": {
                  "mode": "multi",
                  "sort": "desc"
                }
              },
              "fieldConfig": {
                "defaults": {
                  "unit": "currencyUSD",
                  "custom": {
                    "drawStyle": "line",
                    "lineWidth": 2,
                    "fillOpacity": 15,
                    "gradientMode": "none",
                    "showPoints": "never",
                    "pointSize": 5,
                    "barAlignment": 0,
                    "spanNulls": false,
                    "axisSoftMin": 0,
                    "stacking": {
                      "mode": "none",
                      "group": "A"
                    }
                  },
                  "color": {
                    "mode": "palette-classic"
                  },
                  "decimals": 2
                },
                "overrides": []
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "model-latency": {
        "kind": "Panel",
        "spec": {
          "id": 11,
          "title": "SDK generation latency p95 by agent",
          "description": "Model-operation duration is distinct from the end-to-end section duration. Cloud model calls are required.",
          "links": [],
          "transparent": false,
          "data": {
            "kind": "QueryGroup",
            "spec": {
              "queries": [
                {
                  "kind": "PanelQuery",
                  "spec": {
                    "refId": "A",
                    "hidden": false,
                    "query": {
                      "kind": "DataQuery",
                      "group": "prometheus",
                      "version": "v0",
                      "datasource": {
                        "name": "${ds_prom}"
                      },
                      "spec": {
                        "editorMode": "code",
                        "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95,sum by (le,gen_ai_agent_name) (rate(gen_ai_client_operation_duration_seconds_bucket{service_namespace=\"${prefix}\",service_name=~\"${agents_re}\"}[$__rate_interval])))",
                        "legendFormat": "{{gen_ai_agent_name}}",
                        "range": true,
                        "instant": false,
                        "refId": "A"
                      }
                    }
                  }
                }
              ],
              "transformations": [],
              "queryOptions": {
                "interval": "5m"
              }
            }
          },
          "vizConfig": {
            "kind": "VizConfig",
            "group": "timeseries",
            "version": "",
            "spec": {
              "options": {
                "legend": {
                  "showLegend": true,
                  "displayMode": "table",
                  "placement": "right",
                  "calcs": [
                    "lastNotNull"
                  ]
                },
                "tooltip": {
                  "mode": "multi",
                  "sort": "desc"
                }
              },
              "fieldConfig": {
                "defaults": {
                  "unit": "s",
                  "custom": {
                    "drawStyle": "line",
                    "lineWidth": 2,
                    "fillOpacity": 15,
                    "gradientMode": "none",
